MAIN
MOVE TEMP 25 4
MOVE TEMP 26 HALLOCATE TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 4
MOVE TEMP 28 HALLOCATE TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 C_checkOver
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 30 TEMP 5
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 4
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 3 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
MOVE TEMP 31 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 3 )
PRINT TEMP 31
END
C_checkOver [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 32 8
MOVE TEMP 33 HALLOCATE TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 34 4
MOVE TEMP 35 HALLOCATE TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 36 A_funA
HSTORE TEMP 9 0 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 37 0
MOVE TEMP 38 TEMP 37
HSTORE TEMP 8 4 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 39 TEMP 9
HSTORE TEMP 8 0 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 1
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 0
MOVE TEMP 40 CALL TEMP 12 ( TEMP 10 )
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 40
MOVE TEMP 41 12
MOVE TEMP 42 HALLOCATE TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 42
MOVE TEMP 43 4
MOVE TEMP 44 HALLOCATE TEMP 43
MOVE TEMP 14 TEMP 44
MOVE TEMP 45 B_funA
HSTORE TEMP 14 0 TEMP 45
MOVE TEMP 46 0
MOVE TEMP 47 TEMP 46
HSTORE TEMP 13 4 TEMP 47
MOVE TEMP 48 0
MOVE TEMP 49 TEMP 48
HSTORE TEMP 13 8 TEMP 49
MOVE TEMP 50 TEMP 14
HSTORE TEMP 13 0 TEMP 50
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 1
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 15 0
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 16 0
MOVE TEMP 51 CALL TEMP 17 ( TEMP 15 )
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 51
PRINT TEMP 2

RETURN TEMP 2
END
A_funA [ 1 ]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 18 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 52 10
MOVE TEMP 53 PLUS TEMP 18 TEMP 52
MOVE TEMP 54 TEMP 53
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 54
HLOAD TEMP 19 TEMP 0 4
PRINT TEMP 19
HLOAD TEMP 20 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 20
END
B_funA [ 1 ]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 21 TEMP 0 4
HLOAD TEMP 22 TEMP 0 8
MOVE TEMP 55 PLUS TEMP 21 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 56 TEMP 55
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 TEMP 56
HLOAD TEMP 23 TEMP 0 8
PRINT TEMP 23
HLOAD TEMP 24 TEMP 0 8

RETURN TEMP 24
END

